#NUBITS 8

// The opposite of sapho_all: the smallest program that still does something,
// a constant written out by an 8-bit processor. Its processor must get no
// block it does not use (pay only for what you use): the regression
// synthesises it with Yosys, flattened, and holds the flip-flops and LUTs to
// the counts in cells.txt. hardware.txt holds the sizes the generated top
// passes the processor.
//
// out(0, 5) once                                            -> 5

void main()
{
    out(0, 5);
}
